# ==============================================================================
# UltraMsg API Configuration for Client-Side WhatsApp Notification Delivery
# ==============================================================================
#
# explicit example entries and usage notes for PUBLIC_ULTRAMSG_INSTANCE_ID and PUBLIC_ULTRAMSG_TOKEN:
#
# usage notes for PUBLIC_ULTRAMSG_INSTANCE_ID and PUBLIC_ULTRAMSG_TOKEN:
# 1. Client-Side Exposure: These environment variables must be prefixed with PUBLIC_
#    to be exposed to client-side browser code in Astro / Vite environments.
# 2. Hook Utilization: The values are utilized in src/hooks/useQuoteRequest.ts to securely
#    dispatch WhatsApp quote summaries directly from user flows.
# 3. Phone Number Formatting: Phone numbers provided to the API payload must include the
#    country code without the '+' prefix or spaces (e.g., 919876543210).
#
# explicit example entries:
PUBLIC_ULTRAMSG_INSTANCE_ID=instance12345
PUBLIC_ULTRAMSG_TOKEN=1234567890abcdef
